  <trk>
    <name>Viking Trail stage 8, Österbybruk to Risön (corresponds to Upplandsleden stage 12)</name>
    <desc>The industrial environment disappears and you hike into the wilderness with old forest and marshland. Now you have arrived at Florarna, a nature reserve that is beautiful, barren, wild, and similar to Norrland. </desc>
    <type>pilgrimTrack</type>
